# Leader of the gun thugs outside the Cognetic Bastards' hall. Holds the key to the stolen EBI pallet.

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('b_pallet_bought') || HasFlag('b_pallet_spoiled')
goto: Sold

cond: HasFlag('b_shift_accepted')
goto: Pallet

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (He doesn't move his hand from his gun.) Keep walking.
#
o_text: Walking.
o_id: default_bye
o_goto: End

name: Pallet
npc: The EBI crate? Yeah, that's ours now. Okafor send you? Tell him the price of forgetting is three hundred.
#
o_text: Three hundred. Give me the key.
o_id: buy_pallet
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 300)
o_goto: Bought
#
o_text: That's insulin and plasma under a tarp in the sun. Three days without cold, it's spoiled. Nobody buys it, and the EBI tracks every lot number.
o_id: spoiled_pallet
o_cond: !HasFlag('b_spoiled_tried')
o_test: RollSkill('biochemistry', 'Medium')
o_succ: Spoiled
o_fail: SpoiledFail
#
o_text: Nothing personal.
o_id: kill_leader
o_goto: Kill
#
o_text: I'll think about it.
o_id: pallet_bye
o_goto: End

name: Bought
npc: (He tosses you a key on a strip of red tape.) Padlock's on the crate behind us. Pleasure doing business with Eschaton.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 300)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'pallet_key')
effect: SetFlag('b_pallet_bought')
#
o_text: Pleasure.
o_id: bought_bye
o_goto: End

name: Spoiled
npc: (He lifts the tarp, sniffs, swears.) Three days of guarding garbage. (He throws you the key.) Take it back to Okafor. Tell him it was like that when we found it.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'pallet_key')
effect: SetFlag('b_pallet_spoiled')
#
o_text: I'll tell him.
o_id: spoiled_bye
o_goto: End

name: SpoiledFail
npc: It's in boxes. Boxes keep things. Three hundred.
effect: SetFlag('b_spoiled_tried')
#
o_text: I'll think about it.
o_id: spoiled_fail_bye
o_goto: End

name: Sold
npc: Crate's yours. Don't come back for a refund.
#
o_text: (Leave.)
o_id: sold_bye
o_goto: End

name: Kill
npc: (He grins.) Finally.
effect: StartCombat

name: End
npc: (He spits.)
effect: EndConversation
